@title: mouse_menu_and_board
@context: A context menu, both tiles dragged to Done, and a confirm answered OK.
@tags: mouse
@import: * from '../lib/env.hunt'

STEP 1: Open the page
    NAVIGATE to 'Mouse and keyboard'
    VERIFY that the page is 'Mouse and keyboard'

STEP 2: Rename from the context menu
    RIGHT CLICK the 'File area'
    CLICK the 'Rename' button
    VERIFY that 'Renamed' is present

STEP 3: Drag the first tile
    DRAG 'Write tests' and drop it into 'Done'
    VERIFY that 'Write tests moved to Done' is present

STEP 4: Drag the second tile
    DRAG 'Fix the build' and drop it into 'Done'
    VERIFY that 'Fix the build moved to Done' is present

STEP 5: Copy the link
    DOUBLE CLICK the 'Copy link' button
    VERIFY that 'Link copied' is present

STEP 6: Search
    FILL 'Search' field with 'boots'
    PRESS Enter
    VERIFY that 'Results for boots' is present

STEP 7: Delete the account
    CLICK the 'Delete account' button
    VERIFY that 'Account deleted' is present

DONE.
